  "details": "After a random period of time, some users send and receive times become exactly the same, with the total network travel time seemingly being 0.\n\nIn the attached screenshot, all relevant data is on right side. Serialization Time is result.receiveTime - result.sendTime, Send Time directly reads result.sendTime, Receive Time directly reads result.receiveTime, and Time since startup reads Time.realtimeSinceStartup\n\nHere is the world where the issue was discovered: https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_7fd1ba0f-4d07-4a6f-b984-e48a6d6cc7ad\n\nWhen entering the world, enable debug panel and hit start, and over time keep track of other players serialization data.",
